                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>How much does a logistics app cost?</h3>
                                        <p>MVP: ₹30-70 lakh ($36K-84K). Growth build: ₹1-2.5 Cr ($120K-300K). Enterprise: ₹3-8 Cr ($360K-960K).</p>
                                        <h3>Should I license Onfleet / HyperTrack or build custom dispatch?</h3>
                                        <p>License for MVP and to prove PMF. Build custom when license costs exceed ₹40 lakh / $48K annually or when you need deep customization.</p>
                                        <h3>How long does logistics app development take?</h3>
                                        <p>MVP: 14-20 weeks. Growth build: 24-36 weeks. Enterprise multi-country: 36-56 weeks.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the most common failure mode?</h3>
                                        <p>Under-investing in dispatch and driver ops. The customer-facing app matters less than the operational engine underneath.</p>
